/P 115 0 R
/E (The website also presents an online shop and information about the farm stand. However, the interface remains relatively simple and does not appear to provide many advanced account-management features. The main website focuses more on presenting the farm and its offers than on providing a complete digital customer-management platform.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [4]
>>
