<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 116 0 R
/E (Dharma Farm is a small farm located in Washington, Maine, in the United States. The farm grows vegetables, herbs and seedlings using no-till and bio-intensive farming methods. It offers several ways for customers to purchase its products, including an online store, farmers' markets and a CSA program. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
270 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 116 0 R
/E (Website review:)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
271 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 116 0 R
/E (The Dharma Farm website has a simple structure focused mainly on presenting the farm, its products and its different purchasing options. The homepage provides information about the farm and gives users access to the online store and CSA registration.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
272 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 116 0 R
/E (The online store is particularly interesting from a technical point of view. Customers can select products from different categories, including fresh vegetables and seedlings. They can place orders online and select a specific pickup date. Orders are then prepared and placed in a designated cooler at the farm, where customers can collect them.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
273 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 116 0 R
/E (The website also offers two types of CSA credit: Online Store CSA Credit and Farmers' Market CSA Credit. This system allows customers to purchase credit and use it to buy products either through the online store or at the farmers' market.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
274 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 116 0 R
/E (Another interesting aspect is that the website supports different types of activities. In addition to direct sales, Dharma Farm provides information about its farmers' markets and wholesale activity. This means that the website serves several purposes rather than functioning only as an online shop.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
275 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 116 0 R
/E (However, the website remains relatively simple compared with a more advanced CSA management platform. The online store mainly focuses on ordering products and selecting a pickup date. There is no highly developed customer dashboard visible on the main website, and the subscription management features appear more limited than those of platforms specifically designed for CSA management.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
