/E (In France: The Jardins de Cocagne websites are informative and visually appealing, but they lack comprehensive digital workflows. Subscription options and customer accounts are often missing, hard to find, or scattered across external sites, requiring manual administrative steps and email exchanges to sign up.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
